   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Take Me away** (1 other source): The notes mention a tape flip occurring during this song, though the text is cut off [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Iraqi Suite**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Chat**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- **L.M.L.Y.P**: with Band Intros [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween1998-01-31.Cassettemaster.24bit** (recommended): source not stated; 27 songs; 154 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Guests: Band Intros [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween1998-01-31.Cassettemaster.24bit**: taped by Steve Hanna; transferred by Steve Hanna & Dennis Orr; source: Sony WM-D3 with supplied mic > Master Cassettes (2 x Maxell XLII) [1]",
